B.a1r=s(["The per-item microphone buttons are gone: the system is simply On/Off now, and dictation follows your cursor \u2014 tap any note while recording and your words land there."],t.s)
B.apl=new A.I(374,B.a1r)
B.Z2=s(["Dictation now follows your cursor: while recording, tap into any note and your words land there; tap back to the new-note box and they go there. No per-item mic needed \u2014 the cursor decides."],t.s)
B.ao5=new A.I(373,B.Z2)
B.Ys=s(["One cursor at a time: tapping into an existing note now hides the live box\u2019s blinking cursor, so there\u2019s only ever a single cursor \u2014 the first step toward \u201cdictation goes wherever the cursor is.\u201d"],t.s)
B.aob=new A.I(372,B.Ys)
B.XS=s(["Listening now has real system controls: a media notification + lock-screen transport (play/pause/next/previous), and it responds to Bluetooth media buttons \u2014 including a tap on your Ray-Ban Meta glasses to pause/resume. Works for both spoken (TTS) and recorded playback."],t.s)
B.ao1=new A.I(371,B.XS)
B.WV=s(["Fixed: you can type into a fresh new note again \u2014 its tap target was too thin to focus. It\u2019s a comfortable size now (still not tall).","The Listening player is now two rows: the current item\u2019s overview on top, the play controls below. Tap the overview (\u25ce) to jump the list back to whatever\u2019s playing."],t.s)
B.ame=new A.I(370,B.WV)
B.a_V=s(["Settings is tidier: \u201cDictation destination\u201d and \u201cRecording segmentation\u201d moved into the collapsible Advanced section at the bottom, so the everyday controls lead."],t.s)
B.aoS=new A.I(369,B.a_V)
B.a1M=s(["Play in the Listening list now stays ON THE LIST and follows the playing item down through folders and subfolders \u2014 it no longer jumps the first item into the full-screen player.","A fresh \u201cnew note\u201d box is the right height again \u2014 a blank note no longer opens very tall."],t.s)
B.ama=new A.I(368,B.a1M)
B.a3B=s(["The Listening list now shows ONLY what will play \u2014 an item you\u2019ve un-toggled inside a folder no longer lingers in the list.","Playback now traverses the list in the exact order you see it: a folder\u2019s own items first (top to bottom), then into its subfolders \u2014 so the view follows straight down the list as it plays."],t.s)
B.alH=new A.I(367,B.a3B)
B.a1N=s(["New voice command: while listening for commands (after \u201cend note\u201d), say \u201cplay the listening folder\u201d (or \u201cplay my list\u201d / \u201cstart listening\u201d) and Voicley ends the session and starts reading your listening list \u2014 hands-free."],t.s)
B.anu=new A.I(366,B.a1N)
B.a3r=s(["The Listening list now FOLLOWS playback through the whole hierarchy: as each item finishes, the view scrolls to the next one, and when playback moves into a subfolder that folder opens automatically \u2014 the playing item is always in view."],t.s)
B.anw=new A.I(365,B.a3r)
B.a_N=s(["A new note shows a BLINKING CURSOR from the moment it appears \u2014 always on, right where the next words will land (no keyboard pops up).","The mic label no longer claims \u201cnot available\u201d before you\u2019ve said anything: a quiet room now reads \u201cListening \u2014 waiting for sound\u201d; red is reserved for a mic that actually cut out."],t.s)
B.aoB=new A.I(364,B.a_N)
B.a_q=s(["Your cursor now SURVIVES the mic tap: tapping a note\u2019s mic (or the live box\u2019s) no longer hides the caret \u2014 you can see exactly where the dictation will land."],t.s)
B.aph=new A.I(363,B.a_q)
B.a0e=s(["Dictating with the cursor inside a word no longer splits it \u2014 the new words land right AFTER that word.","New notes are the right height: a closed note no longer keeps invisible trailing blank lines that made a 1\u20132 line note render very tall (existing tall items flatten too)."],t.s)
B.anQ=new A.I(362,B.a0e)
B.ZR=s(["Boxes show up to 15 LINES of text again \u2014 the original spec: a long note lists its first 15 lines with a \u201cmore\u2026\u201d button into the full window (the old rule collapsed anything past ~2 sentences to a 4-line preview)."],t.s)
B.aoW=new A.I(361,B.ZR)
B.YA=s(["Dictated words STAY where they land: a note growing past the \u201clarge\u201d threshold mid-dictation (or mid-typing) no longer swaps its box out from under your cursor \u2014 the transcribed text no longer appears and then vanishes."],t.s)
B.alP=new A.I(360,B.YA)
B.ZJ=s(["Dictating into an item now changes NOTHING on screen: the mic meter/chips stay hidden, the list doesn\u2019t shift, and your box, cursor and keyboard hold perfectly still."],t.s)
B.akS=new A.I(359,B.ZJ)
B.a_v=s(["Fixed for real: tap an item\u2019s mic and the box holds perfectly still \u2014 your cursor stays exactly where you put it, and dictation lands there, not at the bottom."],t.s)
B.apn=new A.I(358,B.a_v)
B.a2U=s(["The mic on an item works the simple way again: for notes under ~15 lines, tapping it changes NOTHING \u2014 same box, same text, and your dictation lands right at your cursor, freely mixed with typing."],t.s)
B.aly=new A.I(357,B.a2U)
B.ZA=s(["Edit mode fixed for real: every note\u2019s text is now fully visible and reachable while editing \u2014 the field follows your cursor and scrolls when needed. Longer notes go to the full window automatically."],t.s)
B.alK=new A.I(356,B.ZA)
B.a2N=s(["Tapping an item\u2019s mic no longer shrinks the box \u2014 the note\u2019s text stays fully visible while you dictate into it (large notes keep their preview height).","This \u201cWhat\u2019s new\u201d popup is easier to read \u2014 bigger text."],t.s)
B.am7=new A.I(355,B.a2N)
B.a_r=s(["Long notes no longer fight the list: a big item shows as a compact preview (title + first lines + \u201ctap to open\u201d), and its reading/editing lives in the full window. Short notes still edit right in place."],t.s)
B.aln=new A.I(354,B.a_r)
B.a20=s(["Dictation now lands WHERE YOUR CURSOR IS when you\u2019re typing \u2014 and the live grey preview flows inline with your words instead of flashing on a line below.","The reader now speaks each item\u2019s TITLE before its text."],t.s)
B.anF=new A.I(353,B.a20)
B.a1l=s(["Listening is now ONE simple switch per item: the headphones tag decides if it plays \u2014 uncheck any item (even inside a playing folder) and it\u2019s out of the playlist; a folder\u2019s headphones just flips everything under it. Playback follows your folder order."],t.s)
B.alu=new A.I(352,B.a1l)
B.WZ=s(["The listening list now shows how many items each folder will play (whole subtree) and a total under the play controls \u2014 the numbers always match what actually plays."],t.s)
B.alI=new A.I(351,B.WZ)
B.XG=s(["The listening list\u2019s controls moved to the TOP: Play-all sits there when idle, and while playing it becomes the full transport \u2014 previous \xb7 play/pause \xb7 next \xb7 stop, with the current title."],t.s)
B.akO=new A.I(350,B.XG)
B.a_m=s(["Silent recordings no longer clutter Home as \u201cTranscribing\u2026\u201d \u2014 they stay in Files with their audio, and a manual retry can still transcribe one."],t.s)
B.amI=new A.I(349,B.a_m)
B.a25=s(["Put your top-level folders in YOUR order: long-press a folder \u2192 Move Up / Move Down \u2014 the order sticks on this device. (Drag-to-reorder polish comes next.)"],t.s)
B.alr=new A.I(348,B.a25)
B.a_H=s(["The Android notification now shows what\u2019s happening live: \u201cDictating\u201d while your words are captured, \u201cPaused \u2014 commands only\u201d while command-listening."],t.s)
B.akT=new A.I(347,B.a_H)
B.a3k=s(["The full-sized item view now leads with the TEXT \u2014 the transcript sits right at the top, with date, folders, player and summary below it."],t.s)
B.an1=new A.I(346,B.a3k)
B.a00=s(["The folder pane no longer flashes when you toggle a note\u2019s listen switch (especially on Windows) \u2014 it holds steady through background syncs."],t.s)
B.alR=new A.I(345,B.a00)
B.a_3=s(["Fixed the main home list jumping around / snapping to the top on every background sync \u2014 it now stays put so you can scroll and focus (especially on Windows)."],t.s)
B.akL=new A.I(344,B.a_3)
B.a2E=s(["Home screen scrolls again: a long note\u2019s box no longer grows past the screen and traps the scroll \u2014 it caps at 15 lines, with the full text one tap away (\u2922)."],t.s)
B.ali=new A.I(343,B.a2E)
B.YF=s(["Voice/shortcut triggers (Hey Google, the launcher shortcuts) no longer switch you to Whisper \u2014 your engine stays put, and the default is always Deepgram (the live one)."],t.s)
B.alg=new A.I(342,B.YF)
B.a_1=s(["When you dictate INTO a note, its box now glows red and pulses with your voice, and the mic turns red \u2014 just like the live box \u2014 so it\u2019s obvious that note is the one recording."],t.s)
B.akA=new A.I(341,B.a_1)
B.Wa=s(["Settings \u2192 \u201cFill in missing titles\u201d now also RE-TRANSCRIBES items that have audio but no text yet \u2014 so text-less notes in your folders/recent get a transcript and a title."],t.s)
B.amE=new A.I(340,B.Wa)
B.YY=s(["A dictation that hasn\u2019t finished transcribing (e.g. you were offline) now shows on Home as \u201cTranscribing\u2026\u201d instead of disappearing \u2014 its audio is always safe and it fills in when the transcript lands."],t.s)
B.al_=new A.I(339,B.YY)
B.a0V=s(["Open straight into command-listening: a new \u201cListen for commands\u201d shortcut (long-press the icon) / voicley://command link \u2014 point a \u201cHey Google\u201d Routine at it."],t.s)
B.akC=new A.I(338,B.a0V)
B.Xm=s(["A folder\u2019s headphones are now a master switch: one tap turns listening on (or off) for EVERYTHING under it \u2014 every subfolder and item."],t.s)
B.ap_=new A.I(337,B.Xm)
B.Xb=s(["Dictating into a note now lets you TYPE while the mic runs \u2014 talk and type at the same time, right in that box, exactly like the live one."],t.s)
B.akU=new A.I(336,B.Xb)
B.Y_=s(["Dictate into a note IN PLACE \u2014 tap a note\u2019s mic and your words now stream into THAT box (no separate \u201cnew\u201d box); \u201cend note\u201d saves them to it."],t.s)
B.an5=new A.I(335,B.Y_)
B.a2j=s(["Item box now keeps the date/time and drops the transcription length (the length shows in the full-window player)."],t.s)
B.aoN=new A.I(334,B.a2j)
B.a0T=s(["The dictation time moved off the item box into the full-sized view \u2014 the box is cleaner (just the length up top)."],t.s)
B.amr=new A.I(333,B.a0T)
B.a15=s(["Toggling a note\u2019s listen switch no longer flashes the folder pane on Windows."],t.s)
B.anM=new A.I(332,B.a15)
B.XI=s(["The note\u2019s mic now works exactly like the live box: tap to dictate into the note, then tap again to pause/resume (mic \u2194 mic-slash)."],t.s)
B.alM=new A.I(331,B.XI)
B.VW=s(["The note\u2019s mic \ud83c\udf99 now sits to the right of the text, in the same spot as the live dictation box."],t.s)
B.alf=new A.I(330,B.VW)
B.a13=s(["Every note now has a mic \ud83c\udf99 \u2014 tap it and keep dictating into that note; your new words append to it. (Audio of the added part comes next.)"],t.s)
B.ams=new A.I(329,B.a13)
B.WC=s(["When a listening playlist reaches the last item, the reader now says it\u2019s restarting from the beginning, then loops."],t.s)
B.aoA=new A.I(328,B.WC)
B.VL=s(["Deleting an item from a folder now leaves it in its other folders \u2014 it only drops out of the one you deleted it from."],t.s)
B.ape=new A.I(327,B.VL)
B.Zb=s(["Say \u201cresume dictation\u201d (or \u201cresume dictating\u201d) to pick your note back up \u2014 and the command chip now says so."],t.s)
B.apc=new A.I(326,B.Zb)
B.Yu=s(["While dragging an item to file it, hover the top or bottom of the folder list to scroll \u2014 reach folders that were off-screen."],t.s)
B.apE=new A.I(325,B.Yu)
B.a2a=s(["Tap an item in a folder or on the home screen to edit it right there \u2014 the \u2922 button opens the full window."],t.s)
B.anr=new A.I(324,B.a2a)
B.a1S=s(["After each update, a quick \u201cWhat\u2019s new\u201d note tells you what changed."],t.s)
B.anc=new A.I(323,B.a1S)
B.W8=s(["Edits you make in the full-window now show in your lists right away."],t.s)
B.amn=new A.I(322,B.W8)
B.XN=s(["Play a folder right in the list \u2014 the current note highlights and stays on top."],t.s)
B.akR=new A.I(321,B.XN)
B.WR=s(["Folders that hold audio-only notes now play their recordings."],t.s)
B.ann=new A.I(320,B.WR)
B.a03=s(["\u201cDictation\u201d is now \u201cNote\u201d everywhere \u2014 say \u201cnew note\u201d (the old \u201cnew dictation\u201d still works)."],t.s)
B.aoi=new A.I(319,B.a03)
B.a0U=s(["Type into your task and meeting boxes while they\u2019re recording."],t.s)
B.amB=new A.I(318,B.a0U)
B.a_o=s(["Talk-or-type: type into the live note box, with a mic button to turn capture on and off."],t.s)
B.aor=new A.I(317,B.a_o)
B.XW=s(["The reader no longer traps you \u2014 move around the app while it plays."],t.s)
B.anm=new A.I(316,B.XW)
B.a_e=s(["\u201cTurn On / Turn Off\u201d buttons, a clearer drag handle, and a steadier folder pane."],t.s)
B.aok=new A.I(315,B.a_e)
B.a0P=s(["Note boxes can grow taller (up to 15 lines)."],t.s)
B.anE=new A.I(314,B.a0P)
